      "AMY: Hey there ladies, my name is Amy and I’il be your waitress today. What can I get you to drink while you're looking at the menu?\nBITCHY LADY: Okay. I'm not trying to be a bitch, but the last four times I've come here, the food has been ewful.\nAMY: Well- um- Well, I apologize for our food the last few times, and we'll certainly do our best to not let that happen again. BITCHY LADY ; Yea…\nBITCHY LADY: Yeah, we'll all have water with lemon. Could you please bring some extra Lemons?",
      "SERENA: First of all, you always ask if something's wrong. Constantly. I've seen you with Kristy. You're always like, 'What's wrong?” \"Bre you okay?…\nAMY: And it's iike a vicious cycle. The more you ask i= something's wrong, the more something becomes wrong. . SERENA It's like a self-fulfilling…\nAMY: And flixt more! No girl is ever gonna know you iike her unless you show it! _ SERENA ~ Okay Brian, that's the lesson for today.",
      "NATASHA: Well yours looks cool. They look like business people.\nAMY: What about mine?\nNATASHA: I don't know. They didn’t speak English. “-\nNAOMI: Foreigners?!",
